>> title: Zabaglione
>> category: Custards & Puddings
>> tags: custard, marsala, egg yolks, stovetop, italian
>> servings: 6
>> time: 30 min
>> step.2: whisk in the Marsala
>> step.3: whisk over simmering water 8 min
>> step.4: whisk over ice until cool
>> step.6: fold in the whipped cream

Whisk @egg yolks{6%large}(110 g), @granulated sugar{1/3%cup}(65 g), @table salt{1%pinch} in a #metal bowl{} until pale.

Whisk @dry Marsala{1/2%cup}(120 mL), @lemon zest{1/2%tsp}(from 1 lemon) into @&(~1)yolks{}.

Cook @&(~1)mixture{} over a pan of barely simmering water, whisking without stopping, until it triples and holds a ribbon.

Set @&(~1)zabaglione{} in a bowl of ice water and whisk until it is cool.

Beat @heavy cream{1/2%cup}(120 mL) to soft peaks.

Fold @&(~1)whipped cream{} into @&(~2)cool zabaglione{}.
